@startuml Departure Process

title Process: departing a convoy
caption Target design. Decisions O36, P4, O3, P9, O7, P11, D35, P8, O4, P17. Plan 13.

|Dispatcher|
start
repeat
  :Review readiness;
  :Depart the convoy;
  |Freedom|
  :Assess every requirement for the convoy\nand each vehicle still travelling;
  if (Any blocking requirement unmet?) then (yes)
    :Refuse, listing each unmet requirement\nand where to fix it;
    note right
      No override, waiver or "depart anyway"
      for any role (O3).
    end note
    |Dispatcher|
    :Fix what is listed;
  else (no)
    |Freedom|
    :Record departure (once only);
    :Show any advisory warnings;
  endif
  |Dispatcher|
repeat while (Departed?) is (no)
->yes;
stop

legend right
  Blocking, per convoy: Convoy Leader assigned;
  accommodation or self-arranged for every crew member
  at every overnight stop.
  Blocking, per vehicle: at least one driver; insurance in
  cover and covering every driver; ferry booked; handover
  Receiver registered; every box attested with a registered
  Receiver; declarations current.
endlegend

@enduml
